Z||000005||Phantom Rage||01-11-2001||01:40 PM||||The spoiler is for my 88 coupe; it is from another coupe, not GT. <P>Yes, I have measured from side to side the spoiler screws and from side to side under the rear deck lid nubs, both about 29 inches apart. <P>I am just not sure if it will place the spoiler too far back or too far forward.<P>Something I just noticed is that the rear spoiler screws are a little bit longer than the front ones.  Maybe it is because the nubs make that part of the deck lid thicker.<P>I can't wait any longer so it's off to a few junkyards to find some samples.  I just wish my brother listened to me when I asked him to compare it to his Formula before he got rid of it.  Well actually I really wish he gave his Formula to me, hehe.<P>Thanks <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>||||reg||7
